# Local assistant instructions.  Deliberately not distributed: the file describes one person's
# bench rather than the driver -- the test machine's address on a home network and how root logs
# in to it -- which is operating detail a reader of this repository neither needs nor can use.
# It is ignored rather than cleaned up and committed, because the next machine's copy will say
# something equally local.
CLAUDE.md

# Build output.  The driver is compiled on the AMIX guest and not here, so nothing in this tree
# produces these today -- they are listed because a build done in place is the obvious next thing
# somebody tries, and an untracked object file is exactly what `git add -A` sweeps in unnoticed.
*.o
*.a
